    "en": {
      "trackName": "Queens Game for Watch Puzzle",
      "description": "A Royal Puzzle Experience on Your Wrist\n\nQueens Game brings the classic N-Queens logic challenge to Apple Watch in a clean, elegant form. Your goal is simple: place the queens so that none can attack each other. Every move requires focus and reasoning.\n\nDesigned for short sessions, Queens Game lets you sharpen your mind anytime — whether on the train, in a meeting break, or before sleep.\n\nKey Features\n\t•\tPure logic gameplay based on the N-Queens puzzle\n\t•\tDesigned exclusively for Apple Watch\n\t•\tProgressive difficulty from easy to expert\n\t•\tWorks completely offline\n\t•\tMinimalist interface and smooth interaction\n\t•\tTrains focus, logic, and spatial thinking\n\nWhy You’ll Love It Queens Game combines classic chess logic with modern minimalism. It’s quick to play, yet mentally rewarding. Each puzzle is handcrafted for clarity and challenge, offering the perfect balance between focus and fun.\n\nIf you enjoy games that make you think — this is your moment of calm logic.\n\nPlay smart. Rule the board.",
